      <p class="eyebrow">About Amicus Shipping LLC</p>
      <h1>Maritime knowledge, put to practical use.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Amicus connects people and technology in international maritime transportation, with a focus on crew connectivity and useful digital tools.</p>
    </div>
