      <div><p class="eyebrow">Who we build for</p><h2 id="about-audience-heading">People on board. People ashore.</h2></div>
      <div class="stack"><p>Individual seafarers can go straight to connectivity and travel guidance. Operators, ship managers, manning companies and agents can explore the tools or discuss a recurring operational need.</p><div class="inline-links"><a class="text-link" href="/seafarers">For seafarers</a><a class="text-link" href="/operators">For operators &amp; agencies</a></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
